@startuml
title 3.5.4 Anonymize matching training data
caption UC-103 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: Proposed entity; no migration
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "System" as Actor
participant "Proposed Anonymization Task" as Page
participant "Proposed Training Service" as Service
participant "matching_training_examples" as Table <<proposed entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Anonymize approved training candidates
activate Page
Page -> Service: 2: Run task with current eligible context
activate Service
Service -> Table: 3: Proposed: read approved candidate dataset
activate Table
Table --> Service: 4: Raw reviewed candidates
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 5: Remove contact, identities, private serials and sensitive OCR
Service -> Service: 6: Run privacy checks; retain non-identifying provenance
Service -> Table: 7: Proposed: save sanitized version and validation receipt
activate Table
Table --> Service: 8: Sanitized training version
deactivate Table
Service --> Page: 9: Sanitized dataset for approval
Page --> Actor: 10: Record task outcome
deactivate Service
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: No active anonymization pipeline or entity migration. Raw images/private claim evidence
require separately approved policy.
endlegend
@enduml
